easier.","TextSheVersion":"You're right, rotting in the septic tank would probably have been easier.","TextTheyVersion":"You're right, rotting in the septic tank would probably have been easier."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1850.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39130","byteOffset":29135336,"byteLength":356}},{"id":"DFr_2411D3D2","articyId":"72057615512929908","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Floyd","text":"It's refreshing to be understood.","speakerId":"Ntt_4168BF6C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's refreshing to be understood.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2450.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36850","byteOffset":28283928,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_68F1C9EF","articyId":"72057615512929920","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Floyd","text":"I'd love to see the world through your silly little meat-eyes. Through my finely tuned third generation Curzona SEE-14B optics, all I see is rot.","speakerId":"Ntt_4168BF6C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'd love to see the world through your silly little meat-eyes. Through my finely tuned third generation Curzona SEE-14B optics, all I see is rot.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2450.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33569","byteOffset":20582624,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_8AEA7508","articyId":"72057615512929956","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Have you stayed in touch with the person you saved?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Have you stayed in touch with the person you saved?","TextSheVersion":"Have you stayed in touch with the person you saved?","TextTheyVersion":"Have you stayed in touch with the person you saved?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2750.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49738","byteOffset":33159416,"byteLength":332}},{"id":"DFr_BAA4FCEF","articyId":"72057615512929964","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Floyd","text":"Absolutely not. What would be the point?","speakerId":"Ntt_4168BF6C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Absolutely not. What would be the point?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3050.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37495","byteOffset":28522872,"byteLength":356}},{"id":"DFr_26346EB3","articyId":"72057615512929971","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"It might offer you some closure.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It might offer you some closure.","TextSheVersion":"It might offer you some closure.","TextTheyVersion":"It might offer you some closure."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3350.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46065","byteOffset":31757464,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_BDDF59BD","articyId":"72057615512929984","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Floyd","text":"Closure is for meat.","speakerId":"Ntt_4168BF6C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Closure is for meat.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3650.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26928","byteOffset":18067944,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_40E21FB7","articyId":"72057615512929991","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Well, I hope you find some peace.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well, I hope you find some peace.","TextSheVersion":"Well, I hope you find some peace.","TextTheyVersion":"Well, I hope you find some peace."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5150.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19807","byteOffset":15375704,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_A5CA69B7","articyId":"72057615512929998","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Floyd","text":"Hmmmmm.","speakerId":"Ntt_4168BF6C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hmmmmm.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5450.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21284","byteOffset":15939112,"byteLength":288}},{"id":"DFr_58CC266C","articyId":"72057615512930149","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Have they ever made contact?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Have they ever made contact?","TextSheVersion":"Have they ever made contact?","TextTheyVersion":"Have they ever made contact?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3950.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46895","byteOffset":32070648,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_2ED58D4D","articyId":"72057615512930156","type":"line","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Floyd","text":"With me? Never, for I am merely a machine, built to serve and save the meat. Why would they waste their time.","speakerId":"Ntt_4168BF6C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"With me? Never, for I am merely a machine, built to serve and save the meat. Why would they waste their time.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4250.0,"y":5